CLEAR resets the ON ERROR handler — 3 machines, boot-per-case

  A  10 ON ERROR GOTO 100 : 20 X=FNZ(1)            -> trapped
  B  10 ON ERROR GOTO 100 : 15 CLEAR : 20 X=FNZ(1) -> NOT trapped

             A: value             A: signal   B: value                           B: signal
  vg8020     'TRAPPED ERR 18 '    on signal   <untrapped: Undefined user function in 20> NEVER
  cf3300     'TRAPPED ERR 18 '    on signal   <untrapped: Undefined user function in 20> NEVER
  zb         'TRAPPED ERR 18 '    on signal   <untrapped: Undefined user function in 20> NEVER
